      <definition>[v. caus. of engkezi-] To bring about peace or tranquility.</definition>
      <page>318</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠡᠩᠺᠠᠵᠢᠺᠥᠯᠦᠨ ᠵᠢᠷᠭᠠᠭᠤᠯᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- yn zirγaγulxu</transcript>
          <definition> To establish peace, happiness, welfare or prosperity.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
